        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jared Harris, Amber Heard, Mamie Gummer, Danielle Panabaker, Laura-Leigh\n- Works: The Ward, Mad Men, Fringe, The Crown, The Expanse, We're the Millers, The Client List, In Which We Meet Mr. Jones\n- Roles: David Robert Jones, Lane Pryce, King George VI, Anderson Dawes\n- Organizations: AMC, Fox, Netflix, Syfy, FBI\n- Places: Frankfurt\n\nFacts:\n- Jared Francis Harris was born on 24 August 1961 and is an English actor.\n- Jared Harris is known for playing Lane Pryce on AMC's Mad Men, David Robert Jones on Fox's Fringe, King George VI on Netflix's The Crown, and Anderson Dawes on Syfy's The Expanse.\n- The film The Ward stars Amber Heard, Mamie Gummer, Danielle Panabaker, and Jared Harris.\n- Laura-Leigh is known for roles in We're the Millers and The Ward, and for being a series regular on The Client List.\n- In the Fringe episode In Which We Meet Mr. Jones, an FBI agent collapses because a parasite constricts his heart.\n- In In Which We Meet Mr. Jones, Olivia must meet biochemist David Robert Jones, played by Jared Harris, in Frankfurt to find a cure.",
